1. A Brief synopsis of this patch

8 Kodi C++ source/header files
The audio and video playback code that our patch modifies

Roughly a few dozen lines of functional changes
Plus a small Android package-name change so our test build can coexist with regular Kodi

The eight C++ files span these areas:
Kodi component	        What we changed
VideoPlayer.cpp	        Preserve original EDL mute behavior except for TrueHD passthrough
VideoPlayerAudio.h/.cpp	Detect mute intervals and pass that information downstream
AudioSinkAE.h/.cpp	    Carry the mute flag into Kodi's audio engine
AEStream.h	            Add a field to carry mute metadata
ActiveAEStream.cpp	    Mark raw audio packets that need pause bursts
ActiveAESink.cpp	      Substitute IEC pause bursts for encoded audio during the applicable mute intervals

These are focused changes rather than a rewrite of Kodi's playback engine. However, they touch several connected layers because the mute decision has to travel from the video player's EDL handling all the way to the audio output.
